  "body": "Thanks, it's fairly cool to see progress here, but couldn't it be more integrated so that I could just click a single button instead of jumping from software 1 to software 2? (this click may just open SMART with parameters explaining where to save the mask after etc)\n\nIt would be great also to create an extension system (like each extension would provide a configuration file in the $XDG_DATA_DIRS that explains how to start the external program with a given input image and output mask) that allows us to plug different AI system (for what I see in https://d2x313g9lpht1q.cloudfront.net/original/3X/c/3/c3b267d5a11c870675503dab7638d3c2b82441a3.mp4 the output of SMART is still not perfect).\n\nEDIT: also, what is the version that features external mask?\n",
